WEBVTT

00:00:28.236 --> 00:00:31.448
THE WAY OF THE HOUSEHUSBAND

00:01:42.018 --> 00:01:42.852
EPISODE 61

00:01:42.936 --> 00:01:43.937
DING DONG

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:45.688
KNOCK-KNOCK

00:01:45.772 --> 00:01:47.315
Yes, I'm coming!

00:01:49.400 --> 00:01:51.069
Time to pay up.

00:01:51.152 --> 00:01:53.321
What? But we don't owe…

00:01:53.905 --> 00:01:56.032
The Residents' Association fee is 500 yen.

00:01:56.574 --> 00:01:59.744
We've finally collected
about half the fees.

00:02:00.328 --> 00:02:02.330
Is this really a job you have to do, Boss?

00:02:02.413 --> 00:02:05.166
It's a direct request
from the association boss.

00:02:05.250 --> 00:02:08.044
If the fees aren't collected,
it's gonna be on me.

00:02:08.127 --> 00:02:11.840
-You learn how to shake 'em down too.
-Yes, sir!

00:02:12.590 --> 00:02:14.592
We're from the Residents' Association.

00:02:14.676 --> 00:02:16.553
Who the hell are you?!

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:17.679
Stay back, Keiko!

00:02:17.762 --> 00:02:20.932
The membership fee is 500 yen.

00:02:21.015 --> 00:02:22.892
I don't have any debts!

00:02:23.726 --> 00:02:25.603
Time to pay up.

00:02:25.687 --> 00:02:28.690
Please spare my child at least!

00:02:29.357 --> 00:02:31.651
We're here to collect
the Residents' Association fee.

00:02:32.402 --> 00:02:34.654
I'm sorry, this is all we have…

00:02:34.737 --> 00:02:35.947
It's 500 yen.

00:02:36.698 --> 00:02:37.824
Boss,

00:02:37.907 --> 00:02:40.952
you really aren't suited
for collecting association fees.

00:02:42.245 --> 00:02:43.538
I'm racking it up.

00:02:44.289 --> 00:02:47.000
I think this place
is within the district too.

00:02:47.083 --> 00:02:47.917
Let's go.

00:02:49.127 --> 00:02:52.380
So, what do you want?

00:02:52.463 --> 00:02:54.632
We're collecting
Residents' Association fees.

00:02:55.216 --> 00:02:56.759
Looking like that?

00:02:57.260 --> 00:02:58.553
Are you messing with us?

00:02:58.636 --> 00:03:01.639
Do you even know where you are?

00:03:01.723 --> 00:03:06.144
I said we shouldn't come in, but…

00:03:06.227 --> 00:03:08.605
I don't know what you're trying to pull,

00:03:09.230 --> 00:03:12.317
but mess with us and you're finished.

00:03:13.067 --> 00:03:15.987
But do you wanna mess
with the Residents' Association?

00:03:16.070 --> 00:03:18.698
We put up the nets
to protect the trash from crows!

00:03:18.781 --> 00:03:21.451
We plan the town festivities!

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:24.245
We maintain the tulip beds in the park!

00:03:25.997 --> 00:03:27.790
The festivities…

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:29.125
The tulips…

00:03:29.709 --> 00:03:32.086
It all comes out
of the association's pockets.

00:03:34.380 --> 00:03:35.256
How much?

00:03:36.299 --> 00:03:37.717
Five hundred yen.

00:03:40.261 --> 00:03:41.638
You got change?

00:03:41.721 --> 00:03:42.639
Um, no.

00:03:43.348 --> 00:03:45.642
-You?
-I've got 200 yen.

00:03:46.476 --> 00:03:47.352
Got change?

00:03:48.186 --> 00:03:49.354
We do.

00:03:50.146 --> 00:03:51.564
We got what we came for.

00:03:54.442 --> 00:03:56.319
EPISODE 62

00:03:58.863 --> 00:04:01.491
Miku. What the hell is this about?

00:04:01.574 --> 00:04:05.453
I'm collecting coupons for a prize draw
where 10,000 will win Policure plates!

00:04:05.536 --> 00:04:07.413
It's Yamapan's Spring Bread Festival!

00:04:07.997 --> 00:04:10.291
These ain't all gonna fit in the freezer.

00:04:10.375 --> 00:04:12.377
How are you gonna take care of them?

00:04:12.460 --> 00:04:14.587
Volume means victory!

00:04:14.671 --> 00:04:16.965
Two points per savory,
one point per sweet bread.

00:04:17.548 --> 00:04:20.677
Sure, but that's just excessive.

00:04:20.760 --> 00:04:22.929
I'm fully prepared for the risks involved!

00:04:24.889 --> 00:04:25.807
Delicious!

00:04:25.890 --> 00:04:27.058
CHEESY CURRY BREAD

00:04:28.226 --> 00:04:29.519
Phew…

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:31.980
Right, okay.

00:04:32.063 --> 00:04:33.773
-Huh?
-I see.

00:04:34.732 --> 00:04:36.526
-That's it for me.
-So soon?!

00:04:37.151 --> 00:04:38.820
What did I tell you?!

00:04:38.903 --> 00:04:40.363
We'll help you, Boss Lady!

00:04:41.739 --> 00:04:42.573
CHOMP

00:04:43.783 --> 00:04:45.118
This curry bread is good!

00:04:45.201 --> 00:04:48.079
To avoid indigestion,
start with the light stuff.

00:04:48.663 --> 00:04:50.540
Drink minimal water!

00:04:50.623 --> 00:04:52.000
Get a good rhythm--

00:04:55.753 --> 00:04:58.381
So this is what ordinary folk
consider a festival?

00:04:58.464 --> 00:04:59.882
They're really something!

00:05:00.466 --> 00:05:03.469
Sorry, Boss Lady…

00:05:03.553 --> 00:05:04.595
I'm done too.

00:05:04.679 --> 00:05:06.973
Is this the end of the road?

00:05:07.056 --> 00:05:08.307
Cobalt Police…

00:05:09.767 --> 00:05:11.769
-There's one way around this.
-What?

00:05:12.854 --> 00:05:14.230
Flavor hacks.

00:05:14.314 --> 00:05:15.690
CHOCOLATE BREAD

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:19.944
A fruit sandwich out of chocolate bread?!

00:05:20.528 --> 00:05:21.696
Wow, looks so tasty!

00:05:21.779 --> 00:05:26.326
Nice! This way, the acidity
will balance out the flavor!

00:05:26.826 --> 00:05:30.997
Stuff your steamed bread with some bacon
and cheese and pop it in the oven…

00:05:31.706 --> 00:05:33.583
And voilà, a bacon-and-cheese loaf!

00:05:33.666 --> 00:05:35.376
Check out that thick-cut bacon!

00:05:35.460 --> 00:05:37.295
And that cheese too, oof!

00:05:37.378 --> 00:05:38.296
Lastly,

00:05:38.379 --> 00:05:40.548
a pizza gratin made with sliced bread!

00:05:40.631 --> 00:05:42.008
It's not even bread anymore!

00:05:45.053 --> 00:05:46.929
I swear, they're multiplying.

00:05:47.764 --> 00:05:49.390
Come on, just try it.

00:05:49.474 --> 00:05:50.475
Right…

00:05:53.394 --> 00:05:54.228
Delicious!

00:05:54.312 --> 00:05:56.773
Wow! I feel like I can keep going now!

00:05:59.442 --> 00:06:01.486
Our mouths were getting all dried out,

00:06:01.569 --> 00:06:03.738
so I made it
with plenty of oil and rich flavor.

00:06:04.322 --> 00:06:05.615
We can do this!

00:06:08.326 --> 00:06:09.702
We're not getting anywhere…

00:06:15.792 --> 00:06:17.668
YAMAPAN SPRING BREAD FESTIVAL
GIFT OFFICER

00:06:17.752 --> 00:06:18.878
SWOOSH

00:06:18.961 --> 00:06:20.004
CLACK

00:06:20.963 --> 00:06:22.465
I've rolled the dice.

00:06:22.548 --> 00:06:25.968
Let's see whether Lady Luck
is with me or not.

00:06:27.220 --> 00:06:28.137
Adios.

00:06:31.057 --> 00:06:32.934
EPISODE 63

00:06:33.017 --> 00:06:34.769
I'm not being followed, am I?

00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:37.939
If I'm found out, I'm done for.

00:06:39.232 --> 00:06:40.066
CREAK

00:06:42.401 --> 00:06:43.861
Welcome!

00:06:47.115 --> 00:06:49.242
No, you fool. Keep calm!

00:06:49.325 --> 00:06:53.079
Welcome. May I take your bags?

00:06:53.955 --> 00:06:57.041
The Immortal Dragon!
Tatsu, why are you here?

00:06:57.625 --> 00:07:00.086
I work here part-time, Madam Torii.

00:07:01.462 --> 00:07:04.048
We offer 30 minutes,
one hour, or unlimited--

00:07:04.132 --> 00:07:05.216
Enough!

00:07:05.299 --> 00:07:07.260
Unlimited, obviously!

00:07:08.136 --> 00:07:10.221
We've got some real cuties in.

00:07:11.055 --> 00:07:11.931
Excellent.

00:07:12.014 --> 00:07:13.766
Hardball Tetsu!

00:07:13.850 --> 00:07:15.476
Old Veteran Takeshi!

00:07:15.560 --> 00:07:17.311
Akari the Swift-Paw!

00:07:17.395 --> 00:07:21.274
There's only a limited number,
but I've got some goods.

00:07:21.357 --> 00:07:22.984
It'll draw the kitties.

00:07:23.067 --> 00:07:25.611
Stop chattering on.

00:07:25.695 --> 00:07:28.281
Hand over the entire stash right now!

00:07:28.364 --> 00:07:29.740
Uh, there's just the one bag.

00:07:33.870 --> 00:07:36.497
I see the glint in your eyes, you junkies!

00:07:36.581 --> 00:07:40.459
Oh, what will I do with you all?

00:07:40.543 --> 00:07:42.712
Here now, here's the good stuff.

00:07:43.504 --> 00:07:44.505
I can't bear it…

00:07:48.134 --> 00:07:49.594
I can't help myself!

00:07:51.637 --> 00:07:54.724
Um, Boss Lady, you'll startle our felines.

00:07:57.185 --> 00:07:58.728
What are you looking at?!

00:08:00.271 --> 00:08:01.439
What about that one?

00:08:02.023 --> 00:08:03.649
That one was a stray.

00:08:03.733 --> 00:08:05.902
It won't get close to people.

00:08:06.736 --> 00:08:08.821
A lone wolf, I see.

00:08:08.905 --> 00:08:09.864
No, it's a cat.

00:08:09.947 --> 00:08:13.075
Somehow reminds me of my dearly departed…

00:08:13.159 --> 00:08:15.828
That one'll only respond to this stash.

00:08:16.412 --> 00:08:20.041
Fresh from the mountains,
100% natural green foxtail.

00:08:20.750 --> 00:08:22.710
Spare no expense.

00:08:22.793 --> 00:08:24.003
Give it to me!

00:08:25.046 --> 00:08:26.923
SWOOSH

00:08:27.006 --> 00:08:28.883
SWOOSH

00:08:33.262 --> 00:08:34.096
OOF

00:08:37.808 --> 00:08:39.185
I'm a little peckish.

00:08:39.769 --> 00:08:42.647
Oh, what will I do with you?

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:44.148
We're going home.

00:08:44.232 --> 00:08:46.359
Hold on, Boss Lady, where are you going?

00:08:46.943 --> 00:08:48.736
This is between us.

00:08:48.819 --> 00:08:50.071
Don't meddle.

00:08:50.154 --> 00:08:52.532
No, but… the cat lives here.

00:08:57.620 --> 00:09:02.875
Typhoon No. 7 will be making landfall
this evening and last through the night…

00:09:03.543 --> 00:09:05.044
The wind's really picked up.

00:09:05.127 --> 00:09:06.337
It's finally here.

00:09:07.046 --> 00:09:09.006
This sucker's got guts.

00:09:09.090 --> 00:09:10.675
Well, if you're up for it,

00:09:11.259 --> 00:09:12.677
this is war!

00:09:13.261 --> 00:09:15.388
The battle could be prolonged.

00:09:15.471 --> 00:09:18.349
Gather all the supplies we have!

00:09:18.432 --> 00:09:22.311
I had the day off today too.
I was looking forward to the theme park.

00:09:22.895 --> 00:09:26.524
Roller coasters, haunted houses,
and Ferris wheels galore…

00:09:26.607 --> 00:09:28.776
This typhoon messed up our plans!

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:31.571
How are you gonna settle this?!

00:09:31.654 --> 00:09:32.738
Who're you talking to?

00:09:33.322 --> 00:09:34.865
They're messing with us…

00:09:35.908 --> 00:09:38.911
Just you watch us fortify our territory!

00:09:38.995 --> 00:09:41.872
You picked a fight with the wrong guys!

00:09:42.540 --> 00:09:43.416
Whoa!

00:09:43.916 --> 00:09:46.043
This wind is intense! Are you okay--

00:09:48.796 --> 00:09:50.423
Tacchan!

00:09:50.506 --> 00:09:53.426
Stay back, Miku! It's a raid!

00:09:53.509 --> 00:09:55.636
I'm telling you it's dangerous.
Get inside!

00:09:57.680 --> 00:09:59.515
That took me by surprise.

00:09:59.599 --> 00:10:01.600
Can't believe the roof tile came flying.

00:10:01.684 --> 00:10:03.686
It's just one of their old tricks.

00:10:03.769 --> 00:10:04.854
BUZZ

00:10:04.937 --> 00:10:05.896
Oh, it's Masa.

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:08.024
Hey, Boss?

00:10:08.107 --> 00:10:10.109
What? Are you outside right now?!

00:10:10.192 --> 00:10:12.403
I just went to buy some croquettes.

00:10:12.486 --> 00:10:14.322
I was gonna share them with you, Boss.

00:10:14.405 --> 00:10:18.034
You're outside in these conditions?
Are you joking?!

00:10:18.618 --> 00:10:20.620
Typhoons always make me crave croque--

00:10:21.537 --> 00:10:22.371
Hey!

00:10:22.955 --> 00:10:24.790
Masa! What happened?!

00:10:24.874 --> 00:10:25.958
What's wrong?

00:10:26.709 --> 00:10:28.127
They got Masa!

00:10:28.210 --> 00:10:29.420
You're heading out now?

00:10:29.503 --> 00:10:30.963
It's not safe!

00:10:31.047 --> 00:10:33.633
Still, he's like a little bro to me.

00:10:33.716 --> 00:10:36.135
I can't just leave him. Forgive me, Miku!

00:10:36.218 --> 00:10:38.137
Tacchan! You need a raincoat?

00:10:40.181 --> 00:10:42.058
KATAGI AGENCY

00:10:42.141 --> 00:10:46.020
The place to get croquettes around here
is surely Kiwami Meats.

00:10:47.313 --> 00:10:49.148
Oh, hey, Boss!

00:10:49.231 --> 00:10:50.941
You all right, Masa?

00:10:51.025 --> 00:10:52.401
You're eating them now?!

00:10:52.485 --> 00:10:55.905
Boss, you really wanted
the croquettes, huh?

00:10:55.988 --> 00:10:57.239
Fine then--

00:10:58.282 --> 00:11:00.076
Hurry up, dumbass!

00:11:00.159 --> 00:11:02.036
What? Typhoon my ass.

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:03.996
You're gonna pay--

00:11:05.081 --> 00:11:05.956
What the--?

00:11:07.875 --> 00:11:09.001
No baking necessary!

00:11:09.085 --> 00:11:12.505
Keeps for seven years!
Delicious bread you just open and eat!

00:11:13.130 --> 00:11:13.964
SNATCH

00:11:14.048 --> 00:11:17.426
Paired with leftover croquettes,
and voilà! Croquette buns!

00:11:18.260 --> 00:11:21.347
Hey, what group are you with--

00:11:21.430 --> 00:11:22.723
What the hell are you…

00:11:22.807 --> 00:11:23.891
Delicious!

00:11:24.683 --> 00:11:26.560
You just put it between some bread,

00:11:26.644 --> 00:11:30.147
but it perfectly matches the sweetness
of that juicy meat inside!

00:11:30.231 --> 00:11:33.901
That's right!
That's a Kiwami Meats croquette for you!

00:11:34.693 --> 00:11:36.654
The Way of the Househusband!

00:11:36.737 --> 00:11:38.906
KIWAMI MEATS

00:11:38.989 --> 00:11:39.824
EPISODE 65

00:11:39.907 --> 00:11:42.118
Don't move.

00:11:42.201 --> 00:11:44.578
I'll smash it in with this.

00:11:45.913 --> 00:11:48.040
How's that for you?!

00:11:50.751 --> 00:11:52.503
Damn you…

00:11:52.586 --> 00:11:54.964
This one's up next!

00:11:55.047 --> 00:11:56.465
Come on, that's enough, Boss!

00:11:56.549 --> 00:11:58.717
Hey, there's a river over there!

00:11:58.801 --> 00:12:01.053
There's a hiking trail too, apparently.

00:12:01.137 --> 00:12:01.971
THWACK

00:12:03.389 --> 00:12:06.350
Anything goes here in this lawless land.

00:12:06.434 --> 00:12:08.727
It's up to us to do with it as we please.

00:12:12.231 --> 00:12:15.192
That's right. Burn baby, burn!

00:12:17.153 --> 00:12:18.028
PULL

00:12:18.112 --> 00:12:20.489
Reel it in, Boss Lady!

00:12:20.573 --> 00:12:22.074
All right!

00:12:22.158 --> 00:12:23.284
Um, Boss Lady!

00:12:24.118 --> 00:12:25.745
It seriously stinks of fish!

00:12:27.496 --> 00:12:29.915
What a fine blade.

00:12:29.999 --> 00:12:31.375
CHOP CHOP CHOP

00:12:35.337 --> 00:12:36.464
Miku!

00:12:36.547 --> 00:12:38.299
Miku, stop! You're doing it wrong!

00:12:38.382 --> 00:12:40.551
I gutted the fish, Boss.

00:12:40.634 --> 00:12:41.677
Ow!

00:12:43.345 --> 00:12:45.181
That's premium Koshihikari rice!

00:12:45.264 --> 00:12:48.058
I'll go see if anyone nearby
will share theirs with us!

00:12:49.101 --> 00:12:50.478
Uh, excuse me?

00:12:51.270 --> 00:12:53.314
Quit squawking.

00:12:53.397 --> 00:12:54.231
It's you!

00:12:54.315 --> 00:12:57.693
Camping is about quietly listening
to the sounds of nature.

00:12:58.569 --> 00:13:00.112
The bonfire fire is nice.

00:13:00.196 --> 00:13:02.907
Fire grants us a moment of stillness.

00:13:02.990 --> 00:13:05.993
If you think about it, the point
of camping is to light a bonfire--

00:13:06.076 --> 00:13:07.536
Could ya spot us some rice?

00:13:09.955 --> 00:13:11.999
Pretty pathetic, Tatsu.

00:13:12.082 --> 00:13:13.083
Tora?

00:13:13.667 --> 00:13:15.127
Whaddya want?

00:13:15.211 --> 00:13:18.047
Your boy came to me to make a deal.

00:13:18.672 --> 00:13:22.009
The goods, as promised. Here.

00:13:22.092 --> 00:13:23.802
I don't want any debts.

00:13:23.886 --> 00:13:25.971
Masa, get the white stuff.

00:13:26.806 --> 00:13:28.182
This should seal the deal.

00:13:29.308 --> 00:13:32.102
Marshmallows for dessert, huh?

00:13:32.728 --> 00:13:35.314
Camping ain't just about
roasting stuff on skewers!

00:13:35.397 --> 00:13:37.525
Behold the versatility
of the sandwich press!

00:13:37.608 --> 00:13:41.529
Top your bread with bananas and chocolate,
add marshmallows, then just grill!

00:13:42.238 --> 00:13:44.532
A marshmallow-chocolate-banana toastie,
done!

00:13:44.615 --> 00:13:46.742
Evenly cooked and so easy to make!

00:13:47.993 --> 00:13:49.662
The marshmallow's so melty!

00:13:49.745 --> 00:13:51.205
The banana goes so well!

00:13:51.288 --> 00:13:55.417
Versatile? Give me a break.
It's no match for this baby!

00:13:55.501 --> 00:13:57.878
The camp cooking classic?!

00:13:57.962 --> 00:14:02.049
Roast, boil, steam, fry, deep-fry…
You name it, this will do it all!

00:14:02.132 --> 00:14:03.133
TWENTY MINUTES LATER

00:14:03.217 --> 00:14:04.301
SIMMER SIMMER

00:14:04.385 --> 00:14:07.513
Acqua pazza made with today's catch!

00:14:07.596 --> 00:14:08.889
Wow, how chic!

00:14:09.473 --> 00:14:10.933
Smells amazing!

00:14:11.016 --> 00:14:12.851
The trout isn't fishy at all!

00:14:13.686 --> 00:14:15.896
I just wanted it roasted with salt…

00:14:21.652 --> 00:14:25.281
Come and try the crêpes,
decorated with special doodles!

00:14:27.157 --> 00:14:28.075
Hey there!

00:14:29.410 --> 00:14:31.745
Okay then, one doodle crêpe.

00:14:31.829 --> 00:14:35.541
What? Oh, right. One doodle crêpe.
What doodle would you like?

00:14:36.375 --> 00:14:39.003
-Um, Cobalt Police.
-What?

00:14:39.587 --> 00:14:42.131
You know, the main heroine
from Crimecatch Policure--

00:14:42.214 --> 00:14:44.592
Sorry, you're gonna have to speak louder.

00:14:44.675 --> 00:14:47.553
Cobalt Police from Policure!

00:14:48.137 --> 00:14:51.599
The main heroine in Crimecatch Policure.
Her color scheme is blue--

00:14:51.682 --> 00:14:53.767
Oh, all right, I get it already.

00:14:53.851 --> 00:14:55.019
You got a picture?

00:14:55.936 --> 00:14:56.979
Oh, it's an anime.

00:14:57.563 --> 00:15:00.232
The anime director
worked his way up from the bottom,

00:15:00.316 --> 00:15:02.234
secured rock-solid foundations and skill--

00:15:02.318 --> 00:15:04.820
-So I just gotta draw big eyes.
-No.

00:15:04.903 --> 00:15:07.197
